      "timeZone": "America/Denver"
     },
     "body": "<p>Doing a bit of digging revealed the <a href=\"https://tomcat.apache.org/tomcat-8.5-doc/config/valve.html#Remote_IP_Valve\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">RemoteIpValve</a>, which resolved this for me when I added it to my server.xml for Tomcat. We’ll need to get the documentation updated for anyone with a reverse proxy that goes from https → http in order to get this resolved.</p>",
     "created": "10/Jun/21 12:50 PM",
